{\plain {Because of the smoothness of H1(}{\f1 
w}{), Property 6.3, this limit is well defined
 as an integral. (It may be easier to convince
 oneself of (6.9) as the limiting form of
 (6.8) by approximating the integral (6.9)
 using the "rectangle rule" and getting 
(6.8)!). }{The sequence }{\{g}{\fs16 \dn8 
n}{\}, defined by (6.9a), is the}{\i0 \b 
 i}{\i0 \b nverse discrete time Fourier 
transform (IDTFT)}{\i0 \b .}}
}
