{\plain {The evaluation of the IDTFT (6.9)
 }{ can be done by several methods. The 
simplest method, especially for FIR filters,
 is this. If we are given the }{system function
 H(z), we just express it as power series
 in z}{\fs16 \up6 -1}{ and read out the 
IDTFT- the IR- using the definition (6.5)!
 The symbolic mathematics capability of 
Mathcad can be useful to get the power series:
 we give a simple example.}}
}
