({0:h}NAME)[({0:n}NAME):(1)/(2*{0:\p}NAME)*({0:C}NAME&_n_u_l_l_`({0:z}NAME)^({0:n}NAME-1)*{0:H}NAME({0:z}NAME)&{0:z}NAME)
